            "48:  zealot_desc: \"$zealot$[vassals|E]专注于信仰事务，会被虔诚行动拉拢。狂热或记仇的封臣以及[clergy|E]经常选择这种[vassal_stance|E]。\\n\\n#low $zealot$封臣喜欢领主：#!\\n$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$修建或升级[temple|E][holdings|E]\\n$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$[GetScheme('learn_language').GetTypeName][scheme|E]成功\\n$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$拥有[virtuous|E][traits|E]\\n$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$进行[pilgrimage|E][activities|E]\\n\\n#low $zealot$封臣不喜欢领主：#!\\n$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$向[head_of_faith|E]请求[gold_i][gold|E]\\n$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$拥有[sinful|E][traits|E]\\n$EFFECT_LIST_BULLET$成功完成[GetScheme('study_faith').GetTypeName][scheme|E]\\n\\n他们更喜欢拥有高[learning_i][learning|E]能力的狂热和品行端正的[heirs|E]。\""
